steps.prompt:
Validate the test suite generated for: {{task}}

TESTAGENT_DIR is `{{artifacts.testagent_dir}}`. Read `{{artifacts.research}}` (requirement checklist, bounded inventory, commands) and `{{artifacts.status}}` (what the implementer created, pass by pass). Run your checks: the bounded build, a fresh test run, harness discovery, requirement-to-test mapping, the coverage-gap check, and the quality audit with test-gap-analysis, assertion-quality, and test-anti-patterns. Write the report to `{{artifacts.testagent_dir}}/validation.md` (it must contain the `| Requirement | Evidence |` table), append the verdict and gap list to `{{artifacts.testagent_dir}}/status.md`, and write `{{artifacts.testagent_dir}}/validation.json` LAST.

This workflow re-runs the implement step on your listed gaps until the verdict is CLEAN (at most 3 passes), so name every gap concretely: the implementer acts only on what you list. A CHANGES_NEEDED verdict is a successful validation; finish the step normally. Do NOT write or fix tests yourself.
